 '<p>Now add wings to your imagination and get your dream home with our 30 - year Mortgage plan. With a longer repayment tenure, you can avail higher loan amount and still keep your EMIs small. Competitive loan rates</p><ul><li>&nbsp Fast approvals and closings</li><li>&nbsp Custom-tailored loans & financing options to fit your individual needs</li><li>&nbsp Offering traditional & jumbo mortgage loans, construction and land loans</li>',
 '<ul><li>&nbsp Interest Rate: 4.5000% APR: 4.678%</li></ul>',
 'Prices are subject to change at 1:00 PM CT with market conditions. Rate provided is the rate closest to par based on a loan amount of $125,000, owner occupied, single family 1 unit dwelling, 80% LTV, standard origination fee, and a FICO score of 740+. The specific rate and term depends on your unique credit rating, combined loan-to-value, amount financed and other factors. Rates and terms are subject to change without prior notice; other restrictions may apply. A mortgage of $125,000 for 30 years at 3.87% APR requires a P&I payment of $587.80 per month. Taxes and insurance for escrow payment are not included; your actual payment obligation will be higher. Adjustable Rate Mortgages (ARM) are variable and your annual percentage rate may increase after the original fixed rate period. Contact us for additional information and loan criteria. We do business in accordance with the Federal Fair Housing Law and the Equal Credit Opportunity Act. Certain terms and conditions may apply. Additional loan options available for primary residences, second homes, investment properties and refinances. We require the Truth in Lending, Good Faith Estimate and HUD-1 closing statement from the competitor for comparison purposes in order to receive the $250 if we cant meet or beat your qualified rate. Offer cannot be combined with any other  Mortgage offer.',
