 you will be prompted to re-enter your Passcode, and your session will continue where you left off.</li><li> <strong> Security Technology: 
 </strong> (i) Online Banking uses Secure Socket Layer (SSL) encryption. The system will typically warn you if your Internet Browser does not have 
